1
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:01,679
Judging from this,

2
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:03,799
there's more than one killer.

3
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:05,400
Careful!

4
00:01:14,239 --> 00:01:15,159
Like wild beasts...

5
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:16,239
Not suitable for children!

6
00:01:16,959 --> 00:01:18,040
Master, I'll leave you to it.

7
00:01:18,319 --> 00:01:19,040
I'll give you some privacy.

8
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:33,560
Master.

9
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:34,879
Master.

10
00:01:35,519 --> 00:01:36,200
There's a needle here.

11
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:38,680
Don't touch it.

12
00:01:40,879 --> 00:01:41,480
Careful, it could be poisoned.

13
00:01:48,159 --> 00:01:49,239
The diameter of this needle

14
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:50,560
matches Mengzhu's wound.

15
00:01:51,439 --> 00:01:52,519
It seems the one who attacked you

16
00:01:52,959 --> 00:01:54,239
is the killer who murdered Mengzhu.

17
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,319
The killer tried to attack me.

18
00:01:59,200 --> 00:01:59,879
It seems

19
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:03,239
we're getting closer to the truth.

20
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:17,599
This footprint

21
00:02:18,319 --> 00:02:20,080
was left by the person who attacked me.

22
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:23,039
Judging by the length of this footprint,

23
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:26,159
this person should be eight chi tall

24
00:02:26,639 --> 00:02:27,439
and well-built.

25
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:31,400
A typical trained fighter.

26
00:02:33,759 --> 00:02:34,400
But

27
00:02:34,919 --> 00:02:36,039
this is just one person's footprint.

28
00:02:36,719 --> 00:02:37,520
You just said

29
00:02:37,919 --> 00:02:38,919
there's more than one killer.

30
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:39,800
What do you mean?

31
00:02:40,479 --> 00:02:41,280
As the saying goes,

32
00:02:41,879 --> 00:02:42,840
every trade has its specialists.

33
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,120
In this world,

34
00:02:44,719 --> 00:02:45,680
it's rare for one person

35
00:02:45,919 --> 00:02:47,479
to have so many skills at once.

36
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:49,439
I now suspect

37
00:02:50,319 --> 00:02:52,120
that several killers are working together.

38
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:53,639
And the killers

39
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,680
are from inside the Li mansion.

40
00:02:56,759 --> 00:02:57,759
Then we need to hurry back.

41
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:58,520
Let's go.

42
00:03:04,719 --> 00:03:05,280
Master.

43
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,840
Why is someone burning paper so early?

44
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:17,719
Are you okay?

45
00:03:18,039 --> 00:03:18,479
I'm fine.

46
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:19,919
Master.

47
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:21,719
The fire isn't even out yet.

48
00:03:22,719 --> 00:03:23,599
Careful not to bump into anyone!

49
00:03:26,479 --> 00:03:27,159
There's no one here.

50
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:32,560
Bookworm.

51
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,080
What did you see this time?

52
00:03:37,479 --> 00:03:38,120
Master.

53
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:41,080
Are you hallucinating again?

54
00:03:44,759 --> 00:03:45,319
Just now,

55
00:03:45,879 --> 00:03:46,840
did you really not see an old man

56
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:47,719
and a child?

57
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,120
No, we didn't.

58
00:04:05,319 --> 00:04:05,919
Daughter!

59
00:04:06,439 --> 00:04:07,919
Time to wake up and get ready!

60
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,800
Hurry up and get dressed.

61
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,039
Don't delay the wedding ceremony.

62
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:15,960
Daughter!

63
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,000
Daughter!

64
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,120
Where is she?

65
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,560
Go find her right now!

66
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,040
Tie her up and bring her back if you have to!

67
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:23,680
Yes, sir.

68
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,160
Madam.

69
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,040
Madam.

70
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,680
The wedding ceremony is at seven.

71
00:04:42,839 --> 00:04:43,720
Hurry and come with me to get ready.

72
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,240
I know.

73
00:04:46,279 --> 00:04:47,480
Congratulations.

74
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,480
Your Master Li

75
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,639
is going to marry Inspector Mu.

76
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:52,319
Then

77
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:55,240
I wish you two a loving marriage

78
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,680
and may you have a child soon.

79
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,720
Shut up!

80
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:01,879
Um...

81
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:02,759
Chunmei.

82
00:05:03,519 --> 00:05:05,920
Go heat up a tub of water for me.

83
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,199
I want to train a bit and take a bath.

84
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:09,319
Right away, Madam.

85
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:11,079
Alright.

86
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:12,480
Let's not just stand here.

87
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:13,879
Let's go get some breakfast.

88
00:05:14,279 --> 00:05:14,839
Breakf...

89
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:15,240
Wait, wait.

90
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,480
We can finally leave this place. No!

91
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:17,199
You can't!

92
00:05:17,639 --> 00:05:18,360
Forget breakfast!

93
00:05:18,759 --> 00:05:19,759
We haven't found the killer yet.

94
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:20,360
Nobody is leaving.

95
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,519
It's only an hour until seven.

96
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,920
My dad is about to fire me.

97
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:26,600
I'm telling you.

98
00:05:26,759 --> 00:05:27,399
I saved your life.

99
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,199
You promised me.

100
00:05:28,319 --> 00:05:29,279
You would do as I say.

101
00:05:29,399 --> 00:05:29,759
You can't just...

102
00:05:29,759 --> 00:05:30,639
Okay, okay, okay.

103
00:05:31,399 --> 00:05:33,199
I won't go anywhere, alright?

104
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,360
Good.

105
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,560
Actually...

106
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:38,720
It's quite simple.

107
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,040
The killer

108
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,879
is hiding right inside this mansion.

109
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:45,079
R-Right here?

110
00:05:45,519 --> 00:05:46,000
That's right.

111
00:05:47,319 --> 00:05:47,959
The wooden puppet,

112
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,240
the oleander,

113
00:05:49,839 --> 00:05:50,800
the chandelier, and the old well.

114
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,839
The killer took the most ordinary objects here

115
00:05:55,199 --> 00:05:57,120
and turned them into weapons to murder the Li women.

116
00:05:57,759 --> 00:05:58,959
They even turned the entire mansion

117
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:02,160
into a massive murder weapon.

118
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,079
Then we must conduct

119
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,120
a full search of the Li mansion.

120
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,199
Let's go.

121
00:06:28,399 --> 00:06:29,000
What's wrong?

122
00:06:29,519 --> 00:06:30,600
Miasma-Repelling Grass.

123
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,920
Why is so much Miasma-Repelling Grass planted here?

124
00:06:38,839 --> 00:06:41,240
Even if miasma from the Dragon-Locking Well drifts over,

125
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,639
the people living here

126
00:06:45,199 --> 00:06:46,399
wouldn't get infected.

127
00:06:47,959 --> 00:06:49,360
This is the servants' courtyard.

128
00:07:04,279 --> 00:07:04,759
Chief

129
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,199
I found the young lady.

130
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,040
Where is she?

131
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:09,439
Turns out she stayed at the Li mansion all night.

132
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,319
Protecting Master Li, never leaving his side.

133
00:07:13,639 --> 00:07:15,040
Turns out that damn girl

134
00:07:15,279 --> 00:07:18,000
has been infatuated with Master Li all along!

135
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,240
The wedding ceremony hasn't even happened yet,

136
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,399
and she's already offering herself to him.

137
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,079
Good.

138
00:07:23,879 --> 00:07:24,519
Excellent.

139
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,600
Congratulations, Chief.

140
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,240
You're about to become

141
00:07:27,319 --> 00:07:28,720
Master Li's father-in-law.

142
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,920
The provincial police department,

143
00:07:35,079 --> 00:07:36,120
what time do they start work in the morning?

144
00:07:36,279 --> 00:07:37,600
Director Wu comes in at seven every day,

145
00:07:37,759 --> 00:07:38,680
arriving at the station early.

146
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:41,839
All right.

147
00:07:41,959 --> 00:07:42,959
In half an hour,

148
00:07:43,399 --> 00:07:44,800
I'll give Director Wu a call

149
00:07:46,079 --> 00:07:46,959
to tell him

150
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:48,319
that the Lijia Town Police Station

151
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:50,120
has officially fired Mu Ying.

152
00:07:50,759 --> 00:07:51,600
From now on,

153
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,319
she won't be some Inspector anymore,

154
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,680
but rather

155
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,680
Mrs. Li.

156
00:07:58,199 --> 00:07:58,920
Congratulations, Chief.

157
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:01,480
You'll soon enjoy endless wealth and glory.

158
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,000
That's the woodshed.

159
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,160
Are you going to chop wood?

160
00:08:20,279 --> 00:08:21,040
I smell it.

161
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,839
It smells like a female ghost over there.

162
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,439
You smell it?

163
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:27,079
You mean the three female ghosts in the Li mansion?

164
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,879
Alright, I'll go catch them.

165
00:08:40,399 --> 00:08:41,600
There's nothing here.

166
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:42,720
Bookworm.

167
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,399
There's no female ghost here.

168
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,200
This Li family mansion

169
00:08:46,279 --> 00:08:47,399
is by day a house for men,

170
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,559
by night a den for ghosts.

171
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,200
It's broad daylight, the Yang energy is strong.

172
00:08:50,399 --> 00:08:51,200
They wouldn't dare come out.

173
00:09:14,399 --> 00:09:15,080
Who are you?
